        "Raise both hands to the shoulders, keeping them inside the shawl, and say Allahu Akbar. Then place the right palm over the back of the left hand on the chest." to "Angkat kedua tangan ke bahu, simpan di dalam selendang, dan ucapkan Allahu Akbar. Lalu letakkan telapak tangan kanan di atas punggung tangan kiri di dada.",
